      "text": "You are the biologist on the Aurora Space Station. While you were on duty during the night shift, a meteorite shower struck vital parts of the space station. \nThe station computer is also impacted: most of the information it displays is scrambled and doesn’t seem to make sense. \nYou are now isolated from the other crew and more importantly from the engineer that is stuck in the crew quarters. \nIt rests on you to repair the damages to the space station and help the crew evacuate safely. \nYou find the engineer tool bag, but it seem he decided to add extra security features. To access the tools needed for the repairs, you first need to find the codes for the different locks. \nCrew:\nDr Helena Chen – Captain/Pilot\nAlistair Johnson – Engineer/Communication Officer\nSarah Lancaster – Biologist/Physician",
